# 迁移文件的字节内容会被编译进二进制：sqlx 在 build 期读磁盘字节算 sha384，
# 启动时会拿它跟库里 _sqlx_migrations.checksum 比对。
# 一旦检出时对 migrations/*.sql 做了 CRLF 转换，校验和就对不上，服务会以
# "migration N was previously applied but has been modified" 直接拒绝启动
# （改的是换行符，SQL 语义完全没变）。
# core.autocrlf=true 的机器上默认是 CRLF，所以这里强行钉死 LF，
# 优先级高于 core.autocrlf。
*.sql text eol=lf
# Frozen evaluation prompts are byte-hashed; preserve the same bytes on Windows.
evals/**/*.jsonl text eol=lf
# Frozen historical behavior is byte-hashed, including its measured source snapshot.
evals/stage/legacy-v1/*.json text eol=lf
evals/search/page-v1/profile-search-candidates.rs.txt -text
# Stage sources and build inputs are byte-hashed into .build-manifest.json.
# Pin LF so a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true) produces the same bytes as CI.
tools/*-stage/src/** text eol=lf
tools/*-stage/build.mjs text eol=lf
tools/build-stages.mjs text eol=lf
tools/space-stage/package.json text eol=lf
tools/space-stage/package-lock.json text eol=lf
plugin/ui/vendor/*-stage.js text eol=lf
plugin/ui/vendor/stage-runtime.js text eol=lf
